   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A Happy young South African girl (from the Xhosa tribe) works on her studies and jokes with her friends at at an old worn desk in a class room in the Transkei region of rural South Africa.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
